234
00:19:45,020 --> 00:19:49,560
One mistake people often make is sticking to the same routine.

235
00:19:50,360 --> 00:19:53,340
It is not good for building up your muscles.

236
00:19:53,340 --> 00:19:59,480
I'd like to suggest that you change your routine every other month.

237
00:19:59,760 --> 00:20:07,280
