239
00:20:11,500 --> 00:20:18,540
Another mistake most people make is to workout intensely almost every day.

240
00:20:19,000 --> 00:20:23,980
You need to give your body a break and allow time for the muscles to grow.

241
00:20:24,760 --> 00:20:26,740
It is not the harder the better.

242
00:20:27,300 --> 00:20:30,680
Two hard workout days every week is enough.

243
00:20:30,680 --> 00:20:37,780
